# No runtime secrets are required by the default market-data adapter.
# Optional licensed daily index/ETF fallback. The documented free baseline is
# 20 calls/day and 20 requests/minute. Keep the real value in .env.local or the
# hosted secret store; never commit it.
EODHD_API_TOKEN=
# Optional Twelve Data daily index/ETF fallback. Keep the real value in
# .env.local or the hosted secret store; never commit it. The documented Basic
# plan allows 8 API credits/minute and 800 credits/day, reset at 00:00 UTC.
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=
# Optional Alpha Vantage daily index/ETF fallback. Keep the real value in
# .env.local or the hosted secret store; never commit it. The documented free
# baseline is 25 requests/day.
ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=
# Optional Financial Modeling Prep daily index/ETF and gold fallback. Keep the
# real value in .env.local or the hosted secret store; never commit it. The
# documented Basic plan allows 250 calls/day, resetting at 15:00 US Eastern.
FMP_API_KEY=
# Optional Finnhub global symbol directory. Historical stock candles require
# a compatible paid entitlement. The public docs expose a 30 requests/second
# hard ceiling but not the current free-account minute allowance; verify the
# dashboard. Never commit the real token.
FINNHUB_API_TOKEN=
# Optional U.S. EIA energy-statistics reference source. It is not an OHLC
# market-bar provider. EIA recommends staying below about 5 requests/second and
# 9,000 requests/hour; route-specific throttles can be lower. Never commit the
# real key.
EIA_API_KEY=
# Optional Marketstack index/ETF source. Keep the real value in .env.local or
# the hosted secret store; never commit it. The documented free baseline is
# 100 requests/month; each requested symbol consumes one request.
MARKETSTACK_API_KEY=
# Optional Zhitu SSE/SZSE index daily-bar credential. The documented free
# certificate allows 200 requests/day and 300 requests/minute. Never commit the
# real key.
ZHITU_API_KEY=
# Optional Sina Finance ZYHub credential. The account must have usable balance
# before this candidate can be enabled. No fixed public free quota was found;
# verify balance and product allowance in the dashboard. Never commit the key.
ZYHUB_API_KEY=
# Candidate Tiingo source. The reviewed EOD coverage is limited to supported
# equities, funds, and ETFs; it is not currently in the fallback registry. The
# documented Starter plan allows 50 requests/hour, 1,000/day, 500 unique
# symbols/month, and 1 GB/month.
TIINGO_API_TOKEN=
# Optional AllTick gold fallback. QuantScope validates it against the canonical
# continuous-futures history before promotion. The current Free trial is seven
# days and allows 10 API calls/minute. Never commit the real token.
ALLTICK_API_TOKEN=
# Optional local trial override and explicit expiry timestamp. Remove the
# override after replacing the base token. ISO 8601 timezone is required.
ALLTICK_TRIAL_API_TOKEN=
ALLTICK_API_TOKEN_EXPIRES_AT=
# Optional Juhe Data product key. Entitlement is product-specific; the current
# stock-data allowance is 50 calls/day and the data updates every five minutes.
JUHE_API_KEY=
JUHE_API_DAILY_LIMIT=50
# Optional same-day accounting offset for calls made outside QuantScope.
JUHE_API_USAGE_DATE=
JUHE_API_USAGE_OFFSET=0
